      "questionName": "exhibition, text, webcam, video conference",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Choose the appropriate word to fill in the blank.</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/exams/communication_set_2_e61c5d66.png\" alt width=\"500\"></p>\n<p>Emma: Hi, Jake! How do you use technology to talk to people?</p>\n<p>Jake: Hey, Emma! I often use apps to chat with my friends and family through <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><input id='fbo-901861-0' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-901861-0' type='text' size='18' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901861-0' /></span></strong>.</p>\n<p>Emma: That sounds cool! Do you think communication will change in the future?</p>\n<p>Jake: Yes! I think we will have virtual <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><input id='fbo-901861-1' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-901861-1' type='text' size='12' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901861-1' /></span></strong> where people can meet with 3D avatars.</p>\n<p>Emma: That would be amazing! Will we still use <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><input id='fbo-901861-2' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-901861-2' type='text' size='15' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901861-2' /></span></strong>?</p>\n<p>Jake: Maybe, but I think we will rely more on holograms and smart <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.4</label><input id='fbo-901861-3' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='3' name='fbo-901861-3' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901861-3' /></span></strong> for real-time talks.</p>\n<p>Emma: I cannot wait to see how communication will evolve!</p>",
