      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Complete the text, using the words given.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In the future, communication will be faster and more advanced. People will not need phones or computers to talk. Instead, they might use <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><input id='fbo-901866-0' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-901866-0' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901866-0' /></span></strong> to send thoughts directly to others. This will make conversations easier because people will not need to type or speak.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Also, new technology like <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><input id='fbo-901866-1' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-901866-1' type='text' size='14' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901866-1' /></span></strong> will help people see 3D images of their friends during calls. Instead of looking at a screen, they will see a real-life image in front of them. This will make online meetings feel more natural.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">People will also be able to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><input id='fbo-901866-2' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-901866-2' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901866-2' /></span></strong> on small details in a video call to see things more clearly. If they want a bigger view, they can<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><input id='fbo-901866-3' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-901866-3' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901866-3' /></span></strong> to see everything around the speaker.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">With these changes, people will communicate in new ways that make life more exciting and connected. The future of communication will be amazing!</p>",
